<ul>
<li>Graves, Kimberly. 2007. CEH: official certified ethical hacker review guide. Canada: Wiley Publishing, Inc.</li>
<li>Gregg, Michael. 2008. The Certified Ethical Hacker. India: Dorling Kindersley</li>
