<li>Straubhaar, Joseph &amp; LaRose, Robert. (2004). Media Now: Communications Media in the Information Age. Belmont, CA: Wadsworth. Page 30-63.</li>
<li>Alaydrus, Mudrik (2009). Saluran Transmisi Telekomunikasi. Jogjakarta: Graha Ilmu.</li>
</ul>

